      "message": "fix(ui): the link check reads the clock seam, so the browser build compiles\n\nmodel_link_watch.rs (#2463) took std::time::Instant, but State passes\ncamcraft_app::clock::Instant, which is web_time::Instant on\nwasm32-unknown-unknown: web/build-app-wasm.sh failed with E0308 at\nstate.rs:3130. The check now reads the clock seam like the rest of the UI.\n\nFixes #2708\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MLU9aif5zm7mure23AKftd",
